     2  *>****************************************************************
     3  *>                       Employee   Entry                        *
     4  *>                                                               *
     5  *>                      This is in three passes namely :-        *
     6  *>                      1. Primary Data incl. name & address etc.*
     7  *>                      2. Earn/Ded & Cost.                      *
     8  *>                      3. Rate Data.                            *
     9  *>                      4. Emp History data entry/amend          *
    10  *>                          from pyupdhis                        *
    11  *>                                                               *
    12  *>                      Each can be selected or                  *
    13  *>                          options 1 & 2 as menu option 4  or.  *
    14  *>                                  1, 2, 3 or 4.                *
    15  *>                                                               *
    16  *>                  MANUAL UPDATE NEEDED.                        *
    17  *>                                                               *
    18  *>  Option 4 only run if emp not had a pay run <<<<<<<<<<    NEEDS EXTRA CODING
    19  *>    This program sets up Emp-Search-Name from Emp-Name         *
    20  *>                                                               *
