    34  *>    Remarks.          Employee data Entry.
    35  *>                      This is in three passes namely :-
    36  *>                      1. Primary Data included name & address etc.
    37  *>                      2. Earn/Ded & Cost.
    38  *>                      3. Rate Data.
    39  *>                      4. Update Employee History.
    40  *>
    41  *>                      Each can be selected or
    42  *>                          options 1 & 2 as menu option 4  or.
    43  *>                                  1, 2 & 3.
    44  *>
    45  *>                      Semi-sourced from Basic code from *> empent.
    46  *>**
