    83  *> Changes:
    84  *> 20/09/2025 vbc - 1.0.00 Created - starting. Prior to testing.
    85  *>                         After testing version will be set to v3.3.
    86  *>                         WARNING: You MUST set the terminal program to be 80
    87  *>                         cols wide and MORE than 27 lines deep and this is to
    88  *>                         allow for the some of the extra lines beyond 24 to
    89  *>                         be used as areas for the warning or error messages
    90  *>                         to be displayed. 26 lines is the minimum.
    91  *>                         This procedure must be applied at all times when
    92  *>                         running Payroll.
    93  *>                         For almost all terminal programs, can be achieved
    94  *>                         by pulling the left and bottom edges of the terminal
    95  *>                         screen with the mouse and holding right button and
    96  *>                         pulling until the correct number is displayed, and
    97  *>                         doing so, one at a time or pulling bottom right
    98  *>                         corner.
    99  *>
   100  *> 30/10/2025 vbc -        Still working on file rec layouts (ws)+ selects (sel)
   101  *>                         & fd's (fd).
