  1482  *>*******************************************
  1483  *>                                          *
  1484  *>  Record Definition For The System File   *
  1485  *>                                          *
  1486  *>*******************************************
  1487  *>  File size 1024 with fillers
  1488  *>   Cleared down update details 01/02/09 to 12/06/13
  1489  *>
  1490  *> 22/09/15 vbc - Added Param-Restrict (Access) within a current filler.
  1491  *>                Set this will stop display of option Z in sub-system menus.
  1492  *>                Need to detect actual user though when setup or could just use
  1493  *>                chown for sys002 to admin user?
  1494  *> 25/06/16 vbc - Added RDBMS-Port & needs RDBMS-Host, RDBMS-Socket.
  1495  *>                Increased 'System-data' from 384 to 512 bytes & removed O/E
  1496  *>                  Block (128) as it is unused.
  1497  *> 26/06/16 vbc - Updated MySQL Load scripts ACASDB.sql in ACAS/mysql.
  1498  *>                  Prima is yet to be done !!!
  1499  *> 19/10/16 vbc - Changed PL-Approp-AC in IRS block from 9(5) to 9(6) for GL
  1500  *>                support & reduced filler by 1.
  1501  *>                With IRS data mapped into ACAS the IRS block can reduce to 32 bytes
  1502  *>                Just need to change all of the IRS programs to use ACAS fields but
  1503  *>                also NEED to change the date processing to use same in rest of ACAS
  1504  *>                and not binary days since 01/01/2000 and hold dates in dd/mm/yy form.
  1505  *>                Added 2 88s to Op-System for IRS.
  1506  *> 27/10/16 vbc - Changed level-5 to IRS instead of omitted O/E.
  1507  *> 15/01/18 vbc - Added Stats-Date-Period with a filler & vers = 14.
  1508  *> 02/02/18 vbc - Replaced file-statuses with filler x(32).
  1509  *> 10/02/18 vbc - For PL-Approp-AC6 move filler to beginning of field as irs
  1510  *>                does not need the leading digit (uses only 5).
  1511  *> 17/03/18 vbc - Added SL-Invoice-Lines within last filler so gone from 45 to 43.
  1512  *> 18/03/18 vbc - Added false for Level-5 & 6, e.g., zero.
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY010    24/03/2026  18:35:52:41                                  Page   29

  1513  *> 06/06/18 vbc - Added six new fields as bin-long to support for G-L and IRS used at same time.
  1514  *>                RDBMS needs to be updated. Done 06/06/16 -> Mariadb backups.
  1515  *>                sys002 needs to be updated if implemented.
  1516  *>                systemMT needs to be updated (in un/load moves).
  1517  *> 03/06/20 vbc - Changes to some RDBMS values.
  1518  *> 10/12/22 vbc - Remove File-Duplicates-In-Use - not used.
  1519  *> 14/04/23 vbc - SL-Autogen added (& PL-Autogen) both using FILLER space.
