  2165  *>
  2166   procedure division using WS-Calling-Data  *> ACAS
  2167                            WS-System-Record *> ACAS
  2168                            To-Day           *> ACAS
  2169                            File-Defs.       *> ACAS
  2170  *>
  2171   aa000-Main                  section.
  2172  *>**********************************
  2173  *> Force Esc, PgUp, PgDown, PrtSC to be detected
  2174       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_EXCEPTIONS" to "Y".
  2175       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_ESC" to "Y".
  2176       move     current-Date to WSE-Date-block.
  2177  *>
  2178       perform  forever
  2179                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
  2180                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
  2181                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
  2182                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
  2183                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
  2184                         exit perform cycle
  2185                end-if
  2186                accept   WS-Env-Columns from Columns
  2187                if       WS-Env-Columns < 80
  2188                         display  SY013    at 0101 with erase eos
  2189                         accept   WS-Reply at 0130
  2190                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
  2191                         exit perform cycle
  2192                end-if
  2193       end-perform.
  2194  *>
  2195  *> Set up error message areas on screen
  2196  *>
  2197       subtract 2 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-22-Lines.
  2198       subtract 1 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-23-Lines.
  2199       move     WS-Env-Lines to WS-Lines.
  2200  *>
  2201  *> Pre setup params for acept_numeric routine
  2202  *>
  2203       move     zeros to AN-Error-Code
  2204                         AN-Return-Code.
  2205       SET      AN-FG-IS-Green    to TRUE.
  2206       SET      AN-BG-IS-Black    to TRUE.
  2207       SET      AN-FG2-IS-Cyan    to TRUE.
  2208       SET      AN-Mode-IS-Update to TRUE.  *> could be AN-MODE-IS-NO-UPDATE to
  2209  *>                                            TRUE on first use.
  2210       move     1 to RRN.
  2211       open     i-o  PY-Param1-File.     *> i-o Will NOT create a file
  2212       if       PY-PR1-Status not = "00"      *> Does not exist yet so back to menu and let user run create
  2213                display  PY139 at line WS-22-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4
  2214                display  PY140 at line WS-23-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY010    24/03/2026  18:35:52:42                                  Page   42

  2215                display  SY003 at line WS-Lines col 1 foreground-color 2
  2216                accept   Menu-Reply at line WS-Lines col 53
  2217                close    PY-Param1-File
  2218                goback
  2219       else
  2220                set      AN-MODE-IS-UPDATE to true
  2221                move     1 to RRN
  2222                read     PY-Param1-File key RRN
  2223                if       PY-PR1-Status not = "00"
  2224                         perform  ZZ040-Evaluate-Message
  2225                         display  PY002         at line WS-23-Lines col 1 with erase eos
  2226                         display  PY-PR1-Status at line WS-23-Lines col 34
  2227                         display  WS-Eval-Msg   at line WS-23-Lines col 37
  2228                         display  SY001         at line WS-Lines    col 1
  2229                         accept   WS-Reply      at line WS-Lines    col 48 AUTO
  2230                         close    PY-Param1-File
  2231                         goback
  2232                end-if
  2233       end-if.
  2234       move     zero  to  Menu-Reply.
  2235       close    PY-Param1-File.
  2236
  2237  *>
  2238  *> REMEMBER TO REOPEN PARAM FILE as I-O AND CLOSE IT AFTER A REWRITE   <<<<<<<<-------
  2239  *>
  2240  *>   JUST FOR A REMINDER
  2241  *> Tables have data stored by Act-No so only can handle act-no > 0 and < 100
  2242  *>
  2243  *>  Now, read in all account records storing details in WS-Account-Table
  2244  *>  as saves searching the file multiple times for same values.
  2245  *>  Will not bother with checking if GL # exist as that Should have been done
  2246  *>  already.
  2247  *>
  2248   aa010-Read-in-Acts-Data.
  2249       open     input    PY-Accounts-File.
  2250       if       PY-ACT-Status not = "00"
  2251                perform  aa135-Act-File-Open-Error
  2252                go  to   aa998-Hard-Quit-All.
  2253  *>
  2254       initialise
  2255                WS-Account-Table.
  2256       move     zeroes to WS-Account-Count.  *> Not used
  2257       perform  forever
  2258                read     PY-Accounts-File Next at end
  2259                         exit perform
  2260                end-read
  2261                if       Act-No   > WS-Account-Table-Size
  2262                         display  PY125 at line WS-22-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4 erase eos
  2263                         display  SY001 at line WS-23-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4
  2264                         accept   Menu-Reply at line WS-23-Lines col 48
  2265                         go to    aa998-Hard-Quit-All         *> close Param & accounts files
  2266                end-if
  2267                if       Act-No < zero
  2268                    or          > WS-Account-Table-Size       *> Otherwise table needs increasing
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY010    24/03/2026  18:35:52:42                                  Page   43

  2269                         display  PY126 at line WS-22-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4 erase eos
  2270                         display  SY001 at line WS-23-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4
  2271                         accept   Menu-Reply at line WS-23-Lines col 48
  2272                         go to    aa998-Hard-Quit-All
