  3650  *> Used for ACCEPT_NUMERIC after CAll Only
  3651  *>
  3652  *>C      copy "an-accept.pl".   *> and  perform  AN-Test-Status
  3653        *>
  3654        *> performed after calling "accept_numeric" routine
  3655        *>
  3656         AN-Test-Status.
  3657             move     zeros to COB-CRT-STATUS.
  3658             evaluate AN-Return-Code
  3659                      when = zero
  3660                               move     zero to COB-CRT-STATUS
  3661                      when > zero and < 49 *> F1 thru F48
  3662                               compute COB-CRT-STATUS = AN-Return-Code + 1000
  3663                      when = 49            *> PAGE-UP - 2001
  3664                               move     2001 to COB-CRT-STATUS
  3665                      when = 50            *> PAGE-DOWN - 2002
  3666                               move     2002 to COB-CRT-STATUS
  3667                      when = 51            *> TAB    - 2007
  3668                               move     2007 to COB-CRT-STATUS
  3669                      when = 52            *> BACK-TAB - 2008
  3670                               move     2008 to COB-CRT-STATUS
  3671                      when = 99            *> ESCAPE - 2005
  3672                               move     2005 to COB-CRT-STATUS
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY010    24/03/2026  18:35:52:43                                  Page   69

  3673                      when other           *> No Others Coded For
  3674                               move     9000 to COB-CRT-STATUS
  3675             end-evaluate.
