  3690  *> ** Author: Gary L. Cutler                                    **
  3691  *> **         CutlerGL@gmail.com                                **
  3692  *> ** Amendments Vincent B. Coen                                **
  3693  *> **         vbcoen@gmail.com                                  **
  3694  *> **                                                           **
  3695  *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
  3696  *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
  3697  *> **                                                           **
  3698  *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
  3699  *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
  3700  *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
  3701  *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
  3702  *>                                                              **
  3703  *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  3704  *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  3705  *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
  3706  *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
  3707  *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
  3708  *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
  3709  *> ***************************************************************
  3710  *>
  3711   EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
  3712   WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3713   WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3714   WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3715   WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3716   when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3717   WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3718   when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3719   WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3720   WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3721   WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3722   WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3723   WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3724   WHEN "24" MOVE "Key Boundary violation   " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3725   WHEN "30" MOVE "Permanent Error          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3726   WHEN "31" MOVE "Inconsistent Filename    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY010    24/03/2026  18:35:52:43                                  Page   70

  3727   WHEN "34" MOVE "Boundary Violation       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3728   WHEN "35" MOVE "File Not Found           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3729   WHEN "37" MOVE "Permission Denied        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3730   WHEN "38" MOVE "Closed With Lock         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3731   WHEN "39" MOVE "Conflict Attribute       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3732   WHEN "41" MOVE "Already Open             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3733   WHEN "42" MOVE "Not Open                 " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3734   WHEN "43" MOVE "Read Not Done            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3735   WHEN "44" MOVE "Record Overflow          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3736   WHEN "46" MOVE "Read Error               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3737   WHEN "47" MOVE "Input Denied             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3738   WHEN "48" MOVE "Output Denied            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3739   WHEN "49" MOVE "I/O Denied               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3740   WHEN "51" MOVE "Record Locked            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3741   WHEN "52" MOVE "End-Of-Page              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3742   WHEN "57" MOVE "I/O Linage               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3743   WHEN "61" MOVE "File Sharing Failure     " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3744   WHEN "71" MOVE "Bad Character LS         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3745   WHEN "91" MOVE "Feature Not Available    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  3746            WHEN OTHER
  3747   MOVE "Unknown File PY-PR1-Status      " TO WS-
  3748  *>
  3749       END-EVALUATE.
  3750
  3751  *>>W Msg29 Caution: One or more replacing sources not found
  3752  *>
  3753   zz040-Eval-Msg-Exit.
  3754       exit     section.
  3755  *>
  3756   zz070-Convert-Date          section.  *>  NOT USED YET
  3757  *>**********************************
  3758  *>
  3759  *>  Converts date in To-Day to UK/USA/Intl date format using ACAS param
  3760  *>*********************************************************************
  3761  *> Input:   To-Day
  3762  *> output:  WS-Date as uk/US/Inlt date format
  3763  *>
  3764       move     To-Day to WS-Date.
  3765  *>
  3766       if       Date-Form = zero
  3767                move 1 to Date-Form.
  3768       if       Date-UK
  3769                go to zz070-Exit.
  3770       if       Date-USA                *> Swap month and days
  3771                move WS-Days  to WS-Swap
  3772                move WS-Month to WS-Days
  3773                move WS-Swap  to WS-Month
  3774                go to zz070-Exit.
  3775  *>
  3776  *> So its International date format
  3777  *>
  3778       move     "ccyy/mm/dd" to WS-Date.  *> Swap Intl to UK form
  3779       move     To-Day (7:4) to WS-Intl-Year.
  3780       move     To-Day (4:2) to WS-Intl-Month.
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY010    24/03/2026  18:35:52:43                                  Page   71

  3781       move     To-Day (1:2) to WS-Intl-Days.
  3782  *>
  3783   zz070-Exit.
  3784       exit     section.
  3785  *>
  3786   zz100-Coh-Read-Error.
  3787       display  PY013 at line WS-23-Lines col 1 erase eos
  3788                              foreground-color 4 BEEP.
  3789       display  PY-COH-Status at line WS-23-Lines col 44.
  3790       move     PY-COH-Status to PY-PR1-Status.
  3791       perform  ZZ040-Evaluate-Message.
  3792       display  WS-Eval-Msg   at line WS-23-lines col 47.
  3793       display  SY001 at line WS-lines col 01 with foreground-color cob-color-red
  3794                                                   erase eol BEEP.
  3795       accept   WS-Reply at line WS-lines col 52 AUTO.
  3796        *>>>Info: Total Copy Depth Used = 03;  Caution messages issued =   2
